  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT&apos;S OBJECTIVE IS TO CONTRIBUTE TO THE DEVELOPMENT AND CONSOLIDATION OF THE NATIONAL SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY SYSTEM. IN CHILE, SUCH A SYSTEM RELATES DIRECTLY WITH THE COUNTRY&apos;S ECONOMICAL AND SOCIAL NEEDS. THE PROGRAM WILL FINANCE THE FOLLOWING 3 MAJOR COMPONENTS: (I) (FONDECYT) FOR SMALL PROJECTS TO MAINTAIN AND STRENGTHEN THE COUNTRY&apos;S CAPACITY TO PERFORM HIGH QUALITY INVEST. (II) (FONDEF) PRIV.  PUB. INST FOR SCIENCE  TECH. (III) DEV. TEC.</narrative>
